# Exposure and verification limits

This folder contains a pre-exposure derivation relative to the current root polynomial-path mediator candidate. Before this folder's final freeze, that candidate was not opened, listed, hashed, searched, or read. No other worker's current work or new unpublished science source was accessed. This is a procedural disclosure, not a claim that a source-hashing script can prove absence of exposure.

The permitted mathematical sources are the complete frozen basis-clock comparison `8c3ba783afdfa526e9da08df73760d8b6f0477c2598002b4c71fc042e480a2c2`, the unchanged complete autonomous candidate `0e91f9369e387608f8fb3720c290e67f6aa98b10f13428866334c8507b9e989d`, and its complete separate report `52eb2e2dcd9fc56a7be490e193b57754bd85bfad5d585244d4a9fce947b4465d`. Their exact identities were refreshed before construction; prior complete readings remain valid. Earlier campaign mass-scaled Laplacian/resolvent work had already been seen and reviewed. No claim of prior-art novelty, first discovery of mass regularization, independence from all earlier mathematics, or independent-model replication is made.

The new path inverse bounds use a prefix-current proof, and the corrector identity, polynomial constants, all local positivity, full scalar, moments, calibration, and release prices are explicit. The basis-clock motion and concentration, unchanged geometric embedding, and general pure-factor replacement lemma are reused from the allowed frozen comparison with their domains intact. An unchanged prior proof is not made newly independent by copying it.

There were no scientific programs, numerical sweeps, exact fixtures, or historical science replays. The two current bounded subprocesses are metadata capture and metadata verification only. Their actual source-at-launch, argv, timestamps, streams, and exit status are preserved. The seal is a recorded direct metadata operation, not an invented third subprocess receipt. There is no root decision for this new derivation in this packet.

The same selected model and reasoning effort were retained. No subagent was spawned. No W/Git/PR/audit/lock/checkpoint/axiom/prompt mutation occurred; no editable prompt file changed. Writes are confined to this folder. No messages to other chats were sent. Parent coordination is not external publication.

Native cooling, pure-state supply, hardware calibration/isolation, release switching, total external compiler length, common physical caps, permanent halting, and recycling remain open. All prices are conditional finite-Hamiltonian allowances; microscopic work/energy identification is not supplied.
